<main id="main">
  <section class="frontispiece">
    <img class="hero-atmosphere" src="/assets/editorial/hero-library-800.webp" width="800" height="450" alt="" decoding="async">
    <div class="shell hero-layout">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="kicker light-kicker">{% if lang == 'en' %}Independent editions · AETERNUS{% else %}Unabhängiges Editionshaus · AETERNUS{% endif %}</p>
        <h1>{% if lang == 'en' %}Literature<br>that <em>endures.</em>{% else %}Literatur,<br>die <em>bleibt.</em>{% endif %}</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">{% if lang == 'en' %}Rediscover classics and historical voices. <br>Carefully translated. Thoughtfully edited.{% else %}Klassiker und historische Stimmen neu entdecken. <br>Sorgfältig übersetzt. Mit Achtung vor dem Original.{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button gold-button" href="/buecher/">{% if lang == 'en' %}Discover our books{% else %}Bücher entdecken{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="{{ catalogue.spotlight.url }}#leseprobe">{% if lang == 'en' %}Read an excerpt (DE){% else %}Eine erste Leseprobe{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        {% if lang != 'en' %}<a class="quiet-link why-hero-link" href="/warum-aeternus/">Warum AETERNUS? →</a>{% endif %}
        <p class="hero-footnote">{% if lang == 'en' %}For the pleasure of losing yourself in a book.{% else %}Für die Freude, sich in einem Buch zu verlieren.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-exhibit">
        <span class="exhibit-label">{% if lang == 'en' %}A book to rediscover{% else %}Ein Buch zum Wiederentdecken{% endif %}</span>
        <a class="hero-book" href="{{ catalogue.spotlight.url }}" aria-label="Wilde Tiere, die ich kannte – Ernest Thompson Seton"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/editorial/cover-wilde-tiere-480.avif"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/editorial/cover-wilde-tiere-480.webp"><img src="/assets/images/cover-wilde-tiere-fallback.jpg" alt="Wilde Tiere, die ich kannte – die AETERNUS-Ausgabe" width="400" height="600" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></picture></a>
        <div class="exhibit-caption"><span>Ernest Thompson Seton</span><a href="{{ catalogue.spotlight.url }}">Wilde Tiere, die ich kannte <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="exhibit-series">BERNSTEIN · 1898</span><p class="exhibit-note">{% if lang == 'en' %}Eight animal stories. A whole world to enter.{% else %}Acht Tiergeschichten. Eine ganze Welt zum Eintauchen.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="house-strip"><div class="shell"><span>{% if lang == 'en' %}Historical voices{% else %}Historische Stimmen{% endif %}</span><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>{% if lang == 'en' %}Carefully edited{% else %}Sorgfältig ediert{% endif %}</span><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>{% if lang == 'en' %}Seven distinctive series{% else %}Sieben eigene Reihen{% endif %}</span></div></div>
  {% if lang != 'en' %}{% include 'why-aeternus-teaser.njk' %}{% endif %}
  <section class="paper-section shell" id="aktuelle-ausgaben">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="kicker">{% if lang == 'en' %}The programme{% else %}Das Verlagsprogramm{% endif %}</p><h2>{% if lang == 'en' %}Worth discovering.{% else %}Eine Entdeckung wert.{% endif %}</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/buecher/">{% if lang == 'en' %}All books{% else %}Alle Bücher{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="books-grid">{% for item in catalogue.featured %}{% include 'book-card.njk' %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="cosmos-invitation" aria-labelledby="cosmos-heading">
    <div class="shell cosmos-invitation-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">{% if lang == 'en' %}The literary atlas{% else %}Der literarische Atlas{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 id="cosmos-heading">{% if lang == 'en' %}Every book opens<br><em>another world.</em>{% else %}Jedes Buch öffnet<br><em>eine neue Welt.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
        <p>{% if lang == 'en' %}From the forests of North America to the mountains of Afghanistan. Discover our books on an interactive map — and follow the connections between them.{% else %}Von den Wäldern Nordamerikas bis in die Berge Afghanistans. Entdecken Sie unsere Bücher auf einer interaktiven Weltkarte – und folgen Sie ihren Verbindungen.{% endif %}</p>
        <a class="button gold-button" href="/kosmos/">{% if lang == 'en' %}Explore the book cosmos (DE){% else %}Den Bücherkosmos entdecken{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <span class="cosmos-count">{{ kosmos.count }} {% if lang == 'en' %}books · one connected world{% else %}Werke · eine verbundene Welt{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      <a class="cosmos-constellation" href="/kosmos/" aria-label="{% if lang == 'en' %}Open the interactive book atlas{% else %}Interaktiven Bücherkosmos öffnen{% endif %}">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 500 360" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="250" cy="180" rx="223" ry="151"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="180" rx="115" ry="151"/><path d="M27 180H473M52 105Q250 145 448 105M52 255Q250 215 448 255M250 29V331"/><g class="cosmos-trails"><path d="M126 104Q203 116 250 177L380 95M250 177Q171 225 112 270M250 177Q310 248 389 263"/></g></svg>
        <img class="cosmos-mini cosmos-mini-one" src="/assets/images/cover-waldhandwerk.webp" width="60" height="90" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <img class="cosmos-mini cosmos-mini-two" src="/assets/images/cover-dschungelbuch-kipling.webp" width="60" height="90" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <img class="cosmos-mini cosmos-mini-three" src="/assets/images/cover-rolf-in-der-wildnis.webp" width="60" height="90" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <img class="cosmos-mini cosmos-mini-four" src="/assets/images/cover-sale.webp" width="60" height="90" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <img class="cosmos-center" src="/assets/images/cover-scouting-for-boys.webp" width="120" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy">
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="discovery-section" id="reihen"><div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="kicker">{% if lang == 'en' %}Follow your curiosity{% else %}Der Neugier folgen{% endif %}</p><h2>{% if lang == 'en' %}A world between the covers.{% else %}Eine Welt zwischen den Seiten.{% endif %}</h2></div></div>
    <div class="discovery-grid">
      <a class="discovery-card" href="/buecher/?reihe=bernstein"><img src="/assets/editorial/mood-bernstein-800.webp" width="600" height="450" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><span class="kicker">BERNSTEIN</span><h3>{% if lang == 'en' %}Into the wild{% else %}Hinaus in die Wildnis{% endif %}</h3><span>{% if lang == 'en' %}Nature, adventure & growing up{% else %}Natur, Abenteuer & Erwachsenwerden{% endif %} →</span></div></a>
      <a class="discovery-card" href="/buecher/?reihe=anthrazit"><img src="/assets/editorial/mood-anthrazit-800.webp" width="600" height="450" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><span class="kicker">ANTHRAZIT</span><h3>{% if lang == 'en' %}Across the frontier{% else %}Jenseits der Grenze{% endif %}</h3><span>{% if lang == 'en' %}World literature & human conflict{% else %}Weltliteratur & menschliche Konflikte{% endif %} →</span></div></a>
      <a class="discovery-card" href="/buecher/?reihe=gruen"><img src="/assets/editorial/mood-gruen-800.webp" width="600" height="450" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><span class="kicker">GRÜN</span><h3>{% if lang == 'en' %}Witnessing history{% else %}Geschichte aus erster Hand{% endif %}</h3><span>{% if lang == 'en' %}Expeditions, campaigns & eyewitnesses{% else %}Expeditionen, Feldzüge & Augenzeugen{% endif %} →</span></div></a>
    </div>
    <div class="series-index">{% for series in catalogue.series %}<a href="{% if lang == 'en' %}/en/series/{% else %}/reihen/{% endif %}{{ series.slug }}/"><span class="series-dot" style="--series-color:{{ series.color }}"></span>{{ series.name }}</a>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="edition-story shell" id="anspruch">
    <div class="editorial-illustration"><img src="/assets/editorial/hero-library-800.webp" alt="{% if lang == 'en' %}Old books and a compass on a writing desk{% else %}Historische Bücher und ein Kompass auf einem Schreibtisch{% endif %}" width="960" height="720" loading="lazy"><span>AETERNUS · EDITION</span></div>
    <div><p class="kicker">{% if lang == 'en' %}Our editorial work{% else %}Unsere Editionsarbeit{% endif %}</p><h2>{% if lang == 'en' %}The voice remains.<br><em>The text opens up.</em>{% else %}Die Stimme bleibt.<br><em>Der Text wird zugänglich.</em>{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if lang == 'en' %}Every new edition begins with the original. We translate, examine and arrange historical works so that readers can encounter their language, ideas and world.{% else %}Am Anfang jeder neuen Ausgabe steht das Original. Wir übersetzen, prüfen und ordnen historische Werke, damit ihre Sprache, ihre Gedanken und ihre Welt wieder erfahrbar werden.{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="principles"><p><span>01</span> {% if lang == 'en' %}Respect for the source{% else %}Achtung vor der Quelle{% endif %}</p><p><span>02</span> {% if lang == 'en' %}Clear, readable language{% else %}Klare, lesbare Sprache{% endif %}</p><p><span>03</span> {% if lang == 'en' %}Historical context{% else %}Historische Einordnung{% endif %}</p></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="{% if lang == 'en' %}/en/edition/{% else %}/edition/{% endif %}">{% if lang == 'en' %}How we work{% else %}So arbeiten wir{% endif %} →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="reading-invitation"><div class="shell reading-invitation-layout">
    <div class="reading-welcome"><p class="kicker">{% if lang == 'en' %}The reading room{% else %}Der Leseraum{% endif %}</p><h2>{% if lang == 'en' %}Stay a little.<br><em>Read a page.</em>{% else %}Ein wenig bleiben.<br><em>Eine Seite lesen.</em>{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if lang == 'en' %}Meet Lobo, the old grey wolf of the Currumpaw valley. An excerpt from our German edition.{% else %}Begegnen Sie Lobo, dem alten grauen Wolf des Currumpaw-Tals. Hier beginnt seine Geschichte.{% endif %}</p><a class="button gold-button" href="{{ catalogue.spotlight.url }}#leseprobe">{% if lang == 'en' %}Continue reading (DE){% else %}Die Geschichte weiterlesen{% endif %} →</a></div>
    <figure class="literary-leaf"><span class="leaf-heading">ERNEST THOMPSON SETON <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> LOBO</span><blockquote lang="de">„Und der König, dessen despotische Macht über die gesamte Ausdehnung dieses Landes lastete, war ein alter grauer Wolf.“</blockquote><figcaption lang="de">Aus <cite>Wilde Tiere, die ich kannte</cite><br>Deutsche AETERNUS-Ausgabe</figcaption><span class="leaf-ornament" aria-hidden="true">❦</span></figure>
  </div></section>
</main>
